#
# This file contains a list of filters in FW1 that are safe positions
# for moving the Acq mirror. I.e., FW1 being in one of these in
# positions will avoid a, "squiggle" on the detector caused by a bright
# star on the acq mirror when it moves.
#
# The first filter listed is used when neither the current or new FW1
# position is safe. I.e., the first entry will be moved in to block any
# light from the acq mirror when it moves, then after the acq mirror is
# in position FW1 will be moved to its final destination.

Dark  
ND100X
